t_item":"- [ ] Add an acceptance criterion that exercises the run half of select-then-run: with the agents extra + credentials present, a rubric-touching range actually runs the selected criterion's fixtures live (or explicitly defer that live exercise to a named child ticket and state why selection-only coverage is faithful for this child).","cohort":["E3","E5","G5","T12","T6","T9","necessity","project.engine-layer-enforcement","project.failure-disposition-contract","project.portability"],"criteria":["E5"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":0.05,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Title: 'Run a criterion's fixtures when its rubric changes'","'The new `--changed-since` form prints the selection unconditionally, then runs each selected criterion live ONLY when the `agents` extra + credentials are present'","All eight ACs assert on printed selection / exit code / stderr / spec-list intersection under 'no model configured'; none asserts that a selected criterion's fixtures actually execute live","AC2: 'issues no model call ... asserting an empty selection and exit code 0 with no model configured' — the live-run path is never exercised by any AC"],"finding":"Every acceptance criterion validates only the SELECTION half of 'select-then-run' (which criterion ids are printed) with no model configured; none exercises the titular RUN half — actually running a selected criterion's fixtures live when the agents extra + credentials are present. The plan's headline deliverable ('Run a criterion's fixtures when its rubric changes') has no end-state-observable proof that the selected fixtures actually run.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd6ebdc0a1f879c60","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria; 'Select-then-run.' paragraph","norm_id":"nb16628f34942ddd2","priority":1.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The select-then-run wiring regresses so a correctly-selected criterion is never actually run live; the suite stays green because every test only checks the printed selection, and the epic's whole reason to exist (running fixtures on rubric change) silently no-ops in CI."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add an AC such as: 'With agents + credentials present, a range touching plan_review_T8.md runs T8's fixtures live (a model call is issued for the selected criterion); verified by an end-to-end test observing the live invocation.' If live execution is out of scope for this child, state that the run half is deferred to a named child and that this child ships selection-only.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"uncertifiable_outcome","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["1 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc80