pts/_mechanism_delta/detect_ci.detect_ci_gates + the delta ratchet fail on any unregistered net-new ci_gate, so the new job's run: step(s) require a baseline entry.","The ticket's own file_impact enumerates BOTH files with reasons ('Register the new non-blocking eval-changed-rubrics ci_gate job'; 'Exclude the new non-blocking (continue-on-error) eval-changed-rubrics job from the Verified-vote parity gate'), yet the plan's Scope and Compatibility/rollback prose list only the engine function, CLI flag, doc row, and workflow job.","Compatibility section asserts 'Back-out is deleting the job, the flag, and the doc row' — incomplete if two additional files must also be edited and reverted."],"finding":"The plan omits two required consumers outside the artifact dirs that adding a push/PR-triggered CI job to prompt-eval.yml forces: scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py (its EXCLUDED_JOBS frozenset) and .github/mechanism-baseline.json (the ci_gate mechanism ratchet).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f658992750942fa21","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope / Compatibility and rollback sections; .github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml","norm_id":"n6657ef8a5bec9d52","priority":0.099,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["make lint/make test in CI: the Verified-gate parity gate reddens because the new push/PR job is neither in vote.needs nor EXCLUDED_JOBS.","The mechanism-delta ratchet fails because the new workflow run: step is an unregistered ci_gate mechanism."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In Scope and Compatibility/rollback, add: '(5) scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py — add the new eval-changed-rubrics job to EXCLUDED_JOBS with a justification (non-blocking, continue-on-error) so the Verified-gate parity gate passes; (6) .github/mechanism-baseline.json — register the new job's run: step(s) as ci_gate mechanisms so the mechanism-delta ratchet passes.' and correct the back-out list to include both.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375